{"id": "1551792202378772572", "channel_id": "1350058928020656178", "author_id": "310254141639491590", "author_name": "alexisvaunt", "content": "Mission H5-2\n\nFirst should be: ||\"A twisted shadow slithered from the Seafarer horde, slamming into **the** hand gripping the Silver Key like lightning. The force hurled you against the railing.\"||\n\nSecond should be: ||\"He will raise our city from the sea, restore our kingdom to this chaotic world, **and forge** a new future for the Seafarers.\"|| OR ||\"He will raise our city from the **sea and** restore our kingdom to this chaotic world, forging a new future for the Seafarers.\"|| This one depends on whether it's meant to be a list of three, or if the first two *are* the third. The intent was unclear to me.\n\nCorrections in **bold**.", "timestamp": "2026-09-22T03:08:11.952000+00:00", "thread_id": "1350058928020656178", "attachments": [{"id": "1551792200390676540", "filename": "image.png", "content_type": "image/png", "size": 674443, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1350058928020656178/1551792200390676540/image.png?ex=6ab3429b&is=6ab1f11b&hm=0a3b3012c04e8ce36f9f43f547db8739b033d3b0f649cc3bf4d7d33fc076b2ea&"}, {"id": "1551792201833390100", "filename": "image.png", "content_type": "image/webp", "size": 190976, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1350058928020656178/1551792201833390100/image.png?ex=6ab3429b&is=6ab1f11b&hm=256e12747930952274f0928c39dd55e1c4aaf4f7779fa0bcfef7026e4c22da41&"}], "thread_title": "【English Translation】Opinions Collection", "forum_channel_id": "1350027302205001779"}
